    description: Aim for 1 second, then fire a special round at an enemy that deals 3x damage, inflicts 40% vulnerability, and set it as the target of focus fire, lasting 5 seconds. Depending on whether Contender is in the front/middle/back row, she will target the furthest enemy within the echelon's range/the enemy with the highest current HP/the nearest enemy respectively. If a Boss unit is present, she will prioritize the Boss. (When equipped with "TC High-Performance Exoskeleton", if the target of Inquisitor's Bullet dies while her skill is active, all other enemy units will be stunned for 2 seconds and lose their shields.
