    description: Attack mode can be switched in battle by pressing the skill button. Fever Mode (default): Burst mode. Deal 3 hits for 40% damage each and increase heat by 1 per attack. When heat is over 15, the current heat stack will reduce accuracy and damage by 3.2% per heat value (max 20 stacks). Note Mode: Single shot mode. Decrease movement speed and evasion by 60%. Each attack will reduce heat by 1. Consecutive attacks on the same target will increase damage and accuracy by 2% per attack (max 10 stacks). (After equipping "GRUNT Rail", Fever Mode attacks have a 40% chance of not triggering heat increase, Note Mode's max stack increases to 15)
