      Active: Activate Arc Shadow for 5 seconds and deploy 999 armor, 3 HP holograms for 3 seconds. The number of holograms deployed depends on the number of Dummy Links. (With the DHG Extended Handguard equipped, additionally deploy new holograms 3 seconds after the skill activates. Each new hologram has 999 Evasion, 1 HP and lasts for 3 seconds. The number of new holograms deployed depends on the number of Dummy Links).
