      '''
      Active: Fire a special grenade to apply 3 stacks of erosion to enemies within a radius of 2.5 and apply 2 extra stacks to the main target. Furthermore, normal attacks apply erosion at 100% chance for 4.8 seconds.
      Passive: Normal attacks have a 38% chance to apply 1 stack of erosion. When an enemy reaches 5 stacks, deal 5.67x damage and 2.3 seconds stun within an extremely small area around that enemy and remove all stacks.
      Erosion effect: Decrease the target's rate of fire and movement speed by 6% for 4.8 seconds. (When "PSP Special Rounds" are equipped, Corrosion also reduces the target's damage and accuracy by 6%.)
      '''
