    skin_name: battle_skill_config-511580110
    buff_id_self: 741101:1
    description: Passive: Every attack expends all ammunition and deals 8 instances of damage to the nearest target (knockback chance will only be checked 1 times, damage does snot stack with Slug or Birdshot ammo). Damage falls off the further away the target is and increases the closer it is, to a maximum of 2.5x damage. Reload time is also decreased by 2s. (When “20-gauge Custom Slug Rounds” are equipped, the active skill is modified: Initial CD 0s, CD 8s, and after the skill is activated, the next attack is a guaranteed hit.)
    lvup_description: Maximum damage multiplier: 2.5x,Reload time: 2 seconds
