    description:
      '''
      Active: Immediately complete a special reload and obtain 3 additional rounds. When using additional rounds, increase damage and accuracy by 30%.
      Passive: After each reload, grant 1 round to other machine guns in the echelon and reduce self reload time by 20%, to a maximum of 60%.
      (When equipped with 8mm Mauser Special Rounds, reloading also increases damage of all machine guns in the echelon by 6% for 10 seconds.)
      '''
