      '''
      Passive: Pekola cannot attack in her initial state. She can only attack once she has gained 5 stacks of buff and recovered her halo.
       Deal 1x damage that ignores armor and shield to the enemy unit with the lowest health percentage, as well as additional damage that equals 5% of the target's lost HP (not exceeding 100% of Pekola's damage stat). Her attacks also have a 6% chance of removing all buffs on the target.
       Active: Grant all allies shields whose value equals 5% of their own maximum HP, lasting 5 seconds.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 10 seconds,Extra damage coefficient: 5%,Chance of removing buffs: 6%
