    description:
      '''
      Active: Attacks of each Dummy are calculated separately. Attacks can be directed at different enemy units but prioritize boss units and high-threat enemies, lasting for 6 seconds. While the skill is in effect, each Dummy Link's first attack inflicts a Silence effect in a 1.5 radius that is only effective on high-threat enemies, lasting 4 seconds.
      Passive: When attacking the same enemy unit, inflict 1 instances of 0.5x damage in a 1.5 radius. This damage automatically hits, is reduced by armor, cannot crit and does not scale with Dummy Links.
      '''
