    skin_name: battle_skill_config-511970101
    buff_id_target: 4863:1
    description:
      '''
      At the start of battle, odd-numbered tiles on the field (numpad layout) become Luna Maria tiles. If there are friendly units standing on Luna Maria tiles, grant friendly units 1 point of Mare Potentia per second, up to a maximum of 100 points.
      Allies standing on Luna Maria tiles will not take odd-numbered amounts of damage below 30 points. Normal attacks performed by friendly units standing on Luna Maria tiles come with a  [Combo Hit] effect, dealing 1 additional instance of 12% damage.
      Active: Consume all Mare Potentia on all friendly units and gain 1 point of rate of fire per point of Mare Potentia expended, lasting for 6 seconds.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 20 seconds,Combo Hit damage: 12%,Duration: 6 seconds
    data_pool_1: "180"
