  {
    id: 12040101
    name: Crash of Bad Luck
    skill_group_id: 120401
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 2
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 300
    start_cd_time: 90
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 6
    action_id: 3521
    is_form_action: 1
    skin_name: battle_skill_config-512040101
    description:
      '''
      Summon a truck in her memory that emerges from behind her and crashes into enemies, dealing damage to all units in the way that equals 5% of their current HP and stunning them for 2 seconds; damage is capped at 10000 points.
      If she herself is hit by the truck, damage, rate of fire, accuracy, and critical rate increase by 10% after the stun wears off, lasting3 seconds.

      If she is the echelon leader, and her four teammates are all Franchouchou members, other Franchouchou members who are not in the echelon will enter the battlefield with 30% of all her stats at the start of the battle to provide support.
      If all Franchouchou members are present at the start of the battle, generate a shield in front of the echelon. The shield's HP, evasion, and armor equal 15% of all Franchouchou members' combined HP, 50% of their combined evasion, and 30% of their combined armor.
      While the shield exists, Franchouchou members take 80% less damage, but once it disappears, they all take 50 points of damage.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 10 seconds,Damage multiplier: 5% of maximum HP,Stat increase: 10%,Duration: 3 seconds
    data_pool_1: "90"
    data_pool_2: "140"
    code: SakuraSkill
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
  }
