  {
    id: 12050601
    name: Romero's Cheering Woof!
    skill_group_id: 120506
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 3
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 450
    start_cd_time: 180
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 23
    action_id: 3547
    skin_action: 593:3569
    skin_name: battle_skill_config-512050601
    description:
      '''
      Passive: At the start of the battle, the zombie dog enters the battlefield with 5% of the present Franchouchou members' combined damage, 30% of their combined rate of fire, and 30% of their combined accuracy.
      This unit cannot be targeted by enemies, cannot make critical hits, and does not benefit from any buff tile effects. When Tae Yamada retreats from the battlefield, the zombie dog will also retreat.
      Active: Throw his own head at the enemies, dealing 2x damage to all enemy units within a 1.5-grid radius and reducing their evasion by 10%, lasting 5 seconds.

      When she is the echelon leader, and her four teammates are all Franchouchou members, other Franchouchou members who are not in the echelon will enter the battlefield with 30% of all her stats at the start of the battle to provide support.
      If all Franchouchou members are present at the start of the battle, generate a shield in front of the echelon. The shield's HP, evasion, and armor equal 15% of all Franchouchou members' combined HP, 50% of their combined evasion, and 30% of their combined armor.
      While the shield exists, Franchouchou members take 80% less damage, but once it disappears, they all take 50 points of damage.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 15 seconds,Inherited damage: 5%,Inherited accuracy: 30%,Damage multiplier: 2x,Evasion reduction: 10%,Duration: 5 seconds
    data_pool_1: "150,1.5"
    data_pool_2: "200,90"
    code: TaeSkill
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
  }
