  {
    id: 71010101
    name: Mixing Time
    skill_group_id: 710101
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 3
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 600
    start_cd_time: 180
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 1
    action_id: 1633
    skin_name: battle_skill_config-571010101
    buff_id_self: 3012:1
    description:
      '''
      During battle, Jill takes 3 seconds to mix different drinks depending upon her equipment. Each drink grants a different buff to her echelon.
      Jill cannot attack. Each point of Jill's base damage stat grants herself 1% skill cooldown reduction (does not affect initial cooldown time), max 30%.
      <color=#db3d3d>■</color>Adelhyde <color=#70ad47>■</color>Flanergide <color=#91c1f0>■</color>Karmotrine <color=#ffb400>■</color>Bronson Ext <color=#2e74b5>■</color>Pwd Delta  
      ╔∷∷∷∷∷∷∷∷♪♪Menu♪♪∷∷∷∷∷∷∷∷╗
       <color=#ffb400>■</color>Bronson Ext<color=#70ad47>■</color>Flanergide<color=#91c1f0>■</color>Karmotrine 
      Big Beer 
       Increase SG armor by 10% and damage and accuracy by 15% for 5 seconds.
       <color=#db3d3d>■</color>Adelhyde<color=#db3d3d>■</color>Adelhyde<color=#2e74b5>■</color>Pwd Delta 
      Brandtini
       Increase MG damage and accuracy by 10% for 5 seconds.
       <color=#db3d3d>■</color>Adelhyde<color=#ffb400>■</color>Bronson Ext<color=#91c1f0>■</color>Karmotrine 
      Piano Woman
       Increase the front column's evasion by 35% and the other positions' damage by 10% for 5 seconds.
       <color=#db3d3d>■</color>Adelhyde<color=#db3d3d>■</color>Adelhyde<color=#91c1f0>■</color>Karmotrine 
      Moonblast 
       Increase all allies' rate of fire by 10% for 5 seconds.
       <color=#ffb400>■</color>Bronson Ext<color=#2e74b5>■</color>Pwd Delta<color=#70ad47>■</color>Flanergide 
      Bleeding Jane
       Increase RF and AR crit rate by 10% and 60% of the crit rate over the cap becomes additional crit damage for 5 seconds.
       <color=#91c1f0>■</color>Karmotrine<color=#91c1f0>■</color>Karmotrine<color=#91c1f0>■</color>Karmotrine 
      Fringe Weaver 
       Increase all allies' damage by 15% for 3 seconds. After the skill effect ends, become drunk and decrease damage and accuracy by 20% for 3 seconds.
       <color=#db3d3d>❈❈❈</color> Default: Sugar Rush
       Increase all allies' damage by 10% for 5 seconds.
      ╚∷∷∷∷∷∷∷♪♪Night Night♪♪∷∷∷∷∷∷╝
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown: 20s,Big Beer Armor Increase: 10%,Big Beer Damage and Accuracy Increase: 10%,Big Beer Duration: 5s,Brandtini Damage and Accuracy Increase: 10%,Brandtini Duration: 5s,Piano Woman Damage Increase: 10%,Piano Woman Evasion Increase: 35%,Piano Woman Duration: 5s,Moonblast Rate of Fire Increase: 10%,Moonblast Duration: 5s,Bleeding Jane Crit Rate Increase: 10%,Bleeding Jane Duration: 5s,Fringe Weaver Damage Increase: 15%,Fringe Weaver Damage and Accuracy Decrease: 20%,Fringe Weaver Duration: 3s,Suger Rush Damage Increase: 10%,Suger Rush Duration: 5s
    code: Jill
    train_coin_type: 1
    target_lost: 2
    interrupt_type: 2
    is_switch: 1
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
  }
