    buff_id_self: 7729:1,7727:-1
    description:
      '''
      At the start of the battle, sacrifice 50 HP to gain "Refuge" buff. While the Refuge buff is in effect, this unit does not lose Dummy-Links.
       The duration of the Refuge buff is determined by the number of AR and SMG units on the battlefield: each AR/SMG unit present (including self) increases the duration by 3.6 seconds.
       Every victorious battle in the same map shortens the duration by 20%, stacking up to 3 times.
      '''
    lvup_description: Refuge buff duration with each AR/SMG unit present: 3.6 seconds
