    description: While the skill is active, regular attacks prioritize enemy units with the highest damage stat. Every normal attack applies a stack of Frost Edge to the target. After every 3 normal attacks and when the skill ends, each stack of Frost Edge deals an additional 0.4x guaranteed damage that ignores armor and shields.
