    skin_name: battle_skill_config-574010501
    buff_id_target: 9433:1
    buff_id_self: 9430:1,943301:1
    description:
      '''
      If there are no more than two different gun types on the battlefield at the start of the battle, apply fragility to all non-boss enemy units until the end of the battle.
      Fragility: When taking a critical hit, take an additional instance of HP shield-piercing damage that equals 2% of current HP, capping at 1000 points.Every 100 critical hits landed by the echelon increase damage of all echelon members by 1% until the end of the battle, stacking up to 3 times.
      '''
    lvup_description: Damage multiplier: 2%.,Damage increase: 1%
    code: pxs_2
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    is_cdr: 1
