    description:
      '''
      Active: Switch between Accuracy Mode and Weak Point Mode.
      Accuracy Mode: Increase all echelon members' accuracy and evasion by 30%. Prioritize attacking the enemy unit with the lowest HP and deal 5% more damage for every 10% HP the target loses.
      Weak Point Mode: Prioritize attacking the enemy unit with the highest HP. Each attack reduces the target's accuracy and evasion by 5%, stacking up to 5 times. Upon reaching 5 stacks, apply an additional 10% vulnerability to the target. All debuffs last 8 seconds.
      '''
    lvup_description: Echelon accuracy and evasion increase: 30%,Enemy accuracy and evasion reduction: 5%,Vulnerability: 10%
    data_pool_1: "4,90"
    data_pool_2: *2000,105
