    description:
      '''
      Summon a group of Halloween Prowlers with a full complement of Dummies and the following stats: HP: 100, damage: 20, rate of fire: 50, accuracy: 50, evasion: 50, lasting for 12 seconds.
       Halloween Prowler: Increase damage and evasion of all friendly melee units within a radius of 3 by 8% and 18% respectively. The buff does not stack.
