    skin_name: battle_skill_config-575014801
    description:
      '''
      At the start of the battle, if there are other SG T-Dolls on the same row, increase chance of knockback by 10%, and all attacks are guaranteed to hit.
       Increase "Activity" by 1 with each attack that hits an enemy.
       When Activity reaches 100, deal fatal damage to the non-elite enemy unit with the highest base damage, then increase self damage by 25%, fire at a rate that is fixed at 1 shot per second and cease reloading until the end of the battle.
      '''
    lvup_description: Damage Increase: 25%
    code: FO12
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
