    description:
      '''
      Passive: When there are fewer than 3 targets, increase critical damage by 30% and deal damage that ignores armor.
       Active: Activate Pursuit Mode, lock onto and attack the closest enemy unit. While Pursuit Mode is active, increase damage of self and her target by 30%, while reducing damage of all other enemy units by 10% for 5 seconds. If the target dies within the duration of Pursuit Mode, terminate Pursuit and increase damage by 100 points. This buff stacks.
      '''
