    description:
      '''
      Increase move speed by 6 points when moving. Depending on her position on the battlefield, apply different buffs on allies:
       When on the front row, increase self armor by 30% and grant other SG T-Dolls on the same row a 16-point shield every second, stacking up to 5 times;
       When on the back row, increase self damage by 30%, increase accuracy and critical rate of MG T-Dolls on the same row by 80 points and 30% respectively.
      '''
