    description:
      '''
      Passive: While reloading, reduce enemy units' rate of fire and accuracy by 10%.
      Active: Increase ammo capacity of self and MG T-Dolls on the same row by 3. Also apply a special buff on allies on her buff tiles that renders all damage intake to a fixed value of 5 for 3 seconds and prolongs the duration of their next reload by 2 seconds.
      '''
