  {
    id: 75027601
    name: Winter Trio
    skill_group_id: 750276
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 7
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 300
    start_cd_time: 180
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 1
    skin_name: battle_skill_config-575027601
    buff_id_target: 8032:1
    description:
      '''
      <color=#0099FF>Lob Mode</color>: Randomly fire 9 ice shells at a column within firing range. Each ice shell does 0.5x damage that scales with Dummy Links within a 1 radius and also applies 2 stacks of <color=#00B0F0>Chilling Mark</color> when it does damage.
      <color=#FFCC00>Impact Mode</color>: Fire ice shells from both cannons at once, dealing one instance of damage that scales with Dummy Links to enemies in the three columns in front of self. This damage drops off with range: 1x/0.6x/0.2x damage that scales with Dummy Links, while also inflicting 4/2/1 stacks of <color=#00B0F0>Chilling Mark</color> respectively.
      <color=#FF0000>Precision Mode</color>: Lock onto the enemy with the highest HP and fire off 9 ice shells, each dealing 1x damage that does not scale with Dummy Links and applying 1 stacks of <color=#00B0F0>Chilling Mark</color>. Once a target is no longer valid, she switches to a different one.
      '''
    lvup_description: Lob Mode Damage: 0.5x,Impact Mode Damage: 1x/0.6x/0.2x,Precision Mode Damage: 1x
    code: Destroyer_C1
    train_coin_type: 4
    is_switch: 1
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
  }
