      Active: Clicking on the skill button toggles between Winter Trio's activation modes: <color=#0099FF>Lob Mode</color>(default),<color=#FFCC00>Impact Mode</color>, and <color=#FF0000>Precision Mode</color>.
      Passive: Destroyer - Fleeting Reindeer's skills use special ice shells which apply <color=#00B0F0>Chilling Marks</color>on hit.
      <color=#00B0F0>Chilling Mark</color>: Each stack of <color=#00B0F0>Chilling Mark</color> decreases the target's ROF by 3% and their move speed by 3%. This effect can stack and lasts for 5 seconds. Once the target has 6 stacks of <color=#00B0F0>Chilling Marks</color>, they are all converted to 1 stacks of <color=#0070C0>Frozen Marks</color>, which freeze the target for 1 seconds.
      '''
