    buff_id_self: 8304:1,8305:1,8324:1,1000:1
    buff_delay: 41
    description:
      '''
      When the skill is activated, deal 1x damage that scales with Dummy-Links to all enemy units within a 3-unit radius while also applying a Tidal Mark to them. While the skill is in effect, normal attacks become slash attacks against the nearest units. Skill duration is 8 seconds.
      Slash attacks against enemy units with Tidal Marks deal an additional instance of 0.7x guaranteed damage that can crit but does not scale with Dummy-Links., When the skill ends, randomly kill an enemy unit with a Tidal Mark whose health is below 20%. After killing an enemy unit in this way, stun all enemy units within a 2-unit radius for 1 seconds. Once the skill ends, all instances of Tidal Mark vanish.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 15 seconds,AoE Link-scaling damage multiplier: 1x
