  {
    id: 75043301
    name: Shark Serve!
    skill_group_id: 750433
    level: 1
    type: 2
    skill_priority: 10
    cd_type: 1
    trigger_id: "50113487"
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 1
    action_id: 8396
    skin_name: battle_skill_config-575043301
    buff_id_self: 3978:1,397801:1,8331:1
    description:
      '''
      After the battle begins, spawn Shark Volleyball reinforcements onto the battlefield at a rate determined by self attack speed. Each Shark Volleyball has 10 points of move speed and inherits 30% of the Jaws Paradise's HP and 10% of its damage, with all other stats being the same as the main unit.
      Shark Volleyballs that make contact with an enemy or which reach their maximum range immediately self-destruct and deal 12x <color=#db3d3d>explosive damage</color> to all units within a 3-unit radius, while also applying 6% vulnerability to them for 3 seconds.
      In Defend and Charge Modes, Shark Volleyballs will travel forward in a straight line until they hit an enemy unit; in Destroy Mode, Shark Volleyballs will seek out the nearest unit and trigger their damage.
      '''
    lvup_description: Inherited HP: 30%,Explosive Damage Multiplier: 12x,Vulnerability effect: 6%
    data_pool_1: *3728
    code: RecceCentreSwim_1
    train_coin_type: 4
    is_switch: 1
    skill_lv_call: 3
  }
