      Each Dummy-Link launches a special Tennis Ball bomb at the current target, dealing 2x damage that scales with Dummy-Links to the target and all enemies in its line of fire behind them. Enemies damaged by this skill receive a mark.
      After this skill, if self DPS is the highest damage among all allies, all marked enemies receive damage equal to 5% of their maximum HP and clear the mark.
      '''
