    description:
      '''
      Passive: At the start of battle, if there are fewer allies than enemies present, gain 50 stacks of Chivalry. Every attack grants 1 stack of Chivalry. Each stack of Chivalry increases damage and armor penetration by 1. Chivalry stacks up to 100 times.
      Active: Prioritize targeting high-threat enemies and deal three additional instances of damage equal to 3% excess armor penetration for 6 seconds. If Chivalry is at maximum points, on skill activation, grant self perfect accuracy and 10% critical damage.
      When M240L is the echelon leader, on skill activation, clear all debuffs from self, all machine guns, and shotguns on her buff tiles. For every debuff cleared, gain 2 points of Chivalry.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 20 seconds,Excess Armor Penetration Damage: 3%,Duration: 6 seconds
    data_pool_1: "180"
    data_pool_2: "110"
    code: M240L
    train_coin_type: 1
