    skin_name: battle_skill_config-575057901
    buff_id_self: 8561:1
    description:
      '''
      Executioner - Blood Fiend Huntress leaps ahead, dealing 4x damage that does not scale with Dummy-Links to enemies within a 2-unit radius around the nearest target, but the damage is split equally across the targets' Dummy-Links. Then, Executioner slashes backwards, dealing 0.6x damage that scales with Dummy-Links to enemies in a 3-unit radius behind the target.
      When the skill ends, gain 100% damage intake reduction, which decreases by 20% per second and is then transformed into a shield with a value that equals 1% of self maximum HP, until the buff wears off.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 15 seconds,Non-Link-Scaling Damage Multiplier: 4x,Link-Scaling Damage Multiplier: 0.6x
    data_pool_1: "2"
    data_pool_2: "400,60"
    code: ExcutionerHalloween_1
    train_coin_type: 4
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
