      During this battle, all friendly units' rate of fire is reduced by 30% and cannot gain rate of fire buffs, while enemies cannot benefit from damage-increasing buffs.
      When other friendly units use their active skill (except for switching modes) or when they finish reloading, the entire echelon gains a 1-point shield and 1% increased damage. This effect lasts 8 seconds and stacks up to 10 times.
      '''
