  {
    id: 75069001
    name: Rampaging Entrance
    skill_group_id: 750690
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 5
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 450
    start_cd_time: 180
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 1
    action_id: 8588
    skill_duration: "60"
    is_form_action: 1
    skin_name: battle_skill_config-575069001
    description:
      '''
      Charge forward riding a motorcycle, pushing enemy units in her way to two sides and dealing 4x damage, while also reducing their damage and accuracy by 10% and 10% respectively for 5 seconds.

      When she is the echelon leader and her four teammates are all Franchouchou members, other Franchouchou members who are not in the echelon will enter the battlefield with 30% of all her stats at the start of the battle to provide support.
      If all Franchouchou members are present at the start of the battle, generate a shield in front of the echelon. The shield's HP, evasion, and armor equal 15% of all Franchouchou members' combined HP, 50% of their combined evasion, and 30% of their combined armor.
      While the shield exists, Franchouchou members take 80% less damage, but once it disappears, they all take 50 points of damage.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 15 seconds,Motorbike damage multiplier: 4x,Damage reduction: 10%,Accuracy reduction: 10%,Duration: 5 seconds
    data_pool_1: "150"
    data_pool_2: "400,90,90"
    code: Saki
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
  }
