      '''
      Passive: Each normal attack by Scarecrow – Demonic Abyss consists of a complete rotation of her three hovering guns, with each shot dealing 40% damage and prioritizing high-threat enemies.
      Active: The hover guns rotate rapidly for 2 seconds, then emit a piercing particle beam from the center of rotation.
      Allies along the line of fire gain a shield with 94% of their own single-Dummy HP for 5 seconds. Enemies along the line of fire take 2.4x damage that scales with Dummy-Links and are paralyzed (cannot move or attack) for 2 seconds.
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 12.3 seconds,Shield multiplier: 94%,Particle Beam Damage Multiplier: 2.4x
