      Active: Gain 20 points of Popularity and stun all enemy units in a distance of 3 in front of self for 1 seconds.
      Passive: When in the team leader position, start battle with 30 points of Popularity. When not the team leader, MGs and SGs on buff tiles gain 100 points of armor-piercing and 30 points of accuracy.
      When an enemy unit loses Dummy-Links, gain 1 points of Popularity, and when a friendly unit loses Dummy-Links, gain 10 points of Popularity.
      When Popularity reaches 20 points: inflict 10% vulnerability on all enemies.
      When Popularity reaches 50 points: damage taken by self and friendly units on the same row is reduced by 5 points.
      nWhen Popularity reaches 100 points: All enemies deal 10% less damage.
