      Every 6 rounds of normal attacks, the next normal attack will turn the nearest enemy unit which is not a marked unit into a marked unit.
      Meanwhile, launch a smoke grenade with a 1.5-square radius at the furthest two enemy units. Non-boss units within the radius of the smoke grenades have their rate of fire and accuracy reduced by 30% for 3 seconds. Smoke grenade effects do not stack.
      '''
    lvup_description: Number of attacks: 6,Stat decrease: 30%
    data_pool_1: "5,1.5,90"
    data_pool_2: "70,70,70"
    code: Nyto_sana3
