    description:
      '''
      Passive: When Dreamer - Moonlit Sentinel is present, attack range of all ranged echelon members increases by 3.
      Active: Fire a penetrating light beam straight ahead, dealing 0.8x guaranteed damage that scales with Dummy-Links and ignores armor.
      If the skill activates while this unit is shrouded by ghostly mist/c the beam attack deals an additional instance of 2x guaranteed damage that ignores armor and penetrates shields to the enemy unit with the highest HP.
      '''
