      Passive: After losing a Dummy-Link, clear all current debuffs, increase evasion by 20%, and gain a shield with 10% of her max. HP, lasting 5 seconds.
      Active: Hack all enemy units on the battlefield, reducing their evasion and armor by 30% for 5 seconds. With every kill that she contributes to while the skill is active, grant all echelon members 1 stack of buff that increases their attack and accuracy by 5%. Grant 3 stacks of buff if an elite enemy is killed. This buff lasts 5 seconds and can stack up to 5 times.
      '''
