      '''
      Passive: Gager - VWV Model's normal attacks deal 2 instances of 0.6x damage, which bypasses shields of any targets inflicted with the <color=#2e74b5>Wet</color> status.
      Active: Gager - VWV Model will select the highest HP enemy and fire 5 times at it rapidly, each attack dealing 1x damage. Then, Gager will throw her weapon at the enemy target's location, dealing 1x damage that scales with dummy links within an area of 3, and apply the <color=#2e74b5>wet</color> status, which lasts 5 seconds.
      '''
