  {
    id: 80350201
    name: Righteous Judgment
    skill_group_id: 803502
    level: 1
    type: 2
    skill_priority: 5
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 1
    start_cd_time: 1
    trigger_id: "803502"
    trigger_type: 6
    trigger_target: 1
    trigger_parameter: "1"
    trigger_buff_id: 4249
    target_select_ai: 1
    is_form_action: 1
    skin_name: battle_skill_config-580350201
    buff_id_self: 4249:-1,4258:1
    description:
      '''
      Whenever taking damage that is below the maximum HP of a single Dummy, there is a 10% chance of gaining an additional evasion check against that instance of damage. A successful evasion check negates that instance of damage. Every stack of damage/accuracy/rate of fire/move speed reduction or Seal of the Avenger present on the attacker increases the chance of gaining the additional evasion check by 5%.
       When Mental Deterrence is active, self attacks apply Seal of the Avenger to targets.
      '''
    lvup_description: Base chance: 10%,Additional chance: 5%
    code: romod
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    skill_lv_call: 2
  }
