    description:
      '''
      When "Crimson Echoes" is activated, apply "Echo" to allies on her buff tiles.
       Echo: Increase damage and accuracy of AR units by 5%, increase evasion of SMG units and reduce their damage intake by 10%, stacking up to 3 times. Units with Echo will apply the same Echo buff to their adjacent (horizontally and vertically, but not diagonally) units after 2 seconds. The Echo buff lasts 6 seconds and does not trigger other skills effects.
      '''
    lvup_description: Damage increase: 5%,Accuracy increase: 5%,Evasion increase: 10%,Damage intake reduction: 10%
    data_pool_1: "180,1.5"
    data_pool_2: "105,110,90"
