    description: Passive: When a shield is active on self, cease normal attacks and gain 1 charge every 1.5 seconds, to a maximum of 3 charges. When charges are full or the shield disappears, make a special attack and clear all charges. At 1 charge, deal 3x damage that always hits to enemies within 3 units ahead of self. At 2 charges, deal an additional 3x damage that always hits to enemies within 5 units ahead of self. At max charges, deal an additional 3x damage that always hits to enemies within 8 units ahead of self. Active: Grant a 22 HP shield, lasting for 5 seconds.
    lvup_description: Cooldown: 20 seconds,Damage multiplier: 3x,Shield Durability: 22 points.
