    description: Passive: Obtain a Tarot Card every 3 attacks, up to a maximum of 3 Tarot Cards. Each Tarot Card increases her damage by 6% for 3s. Active: Consume all Tarot Cards and fire a shot that will not miss, dealing 2x damage to the furthest target and possible critical damage. Additionally, deal additional damage to enemies within a 1-unit radius around the target. The additional damage is equal to 0.3x the number of Tarot Cards consumed, up to a maximum of 0.9x damage.
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 12 seconds,Damage increase: 6%,Duration: 3 seconds,Sniping damage: 2x,Extra damage: 0.3x
    code: rico
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
