    description: Passive: While in Charging Mode, this unit cannot perform normal attacks. For every 2s after a battle has begun, obtain a Charge up to a maximum of 5 Charges. Each Charge increases her damage by 16%. Active: Enter Attack Mode. After Attack Mode expires, reload and remove all damage buff from Charging mode, then re-enter Charging Mode. When equipped with "Spectacles", Charging Mode grants 8-HP shields to all allied units in front of her for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 stacks. When equipped with "Meteorite", Charging Mode increases all allies' damage by 5% for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 stacks. When equipped with "Wristwatch", Charging Mode grants her 1 extra ammo.
    lvup_description: Damage increase: 16%
    code: claes
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
  }
