    description:
      '''
      Passive: At the start of the battle, gain 3 squads of 3-linked reinforcement Dolls that move behind the echelon and start attacking. The reinforcement Dolls have 20% of General Liu's firepower stat, 45% of her rate of fire stat and 25% of her accuracy stat. Each link has 5 HP. All other stats and attack modes are the same as General Liu's.
      Active: Clicking the skill toggles between different modes. Normal Mode (default): Decrease rate of fire by 10% and increase damage by 20%, prioritizing the most distant enemy unit. Automatic Mode: Reduce damage by 10% and increase rate of fire by 20%, prioritizing the closest enemy unit.
      '''
    lvup_description: Damage inheritance: 20%,ROF inheritance: 45%,Accuracy inheritance: 25%
    code: Liu
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    is_manual: 1
    is_cdr: 1
