    description:
      '''
      Passive: If there are enemy units present in melee range, switch to Dagger Mode. Attacks inflict 4 instances of 0.2x guaranteed damage to the closest target.
       Active: Fire 4 times at the current target. Each hit deals 4x guaranteed damage that ignores shields. Each shot requires 1 seconds of aiming.
      '''
