    skin_name: battle_skill_config-590120001
    description: Launch a flying kick against the enemy unit with the highest HP, dealing 5x damage spread across 4 instances to enemies in a radius of 1 units. This damage ignores armor, scales with Dummy-Links, but cannot crit. The attack also induces a debuff to targets within a 4-unit radius, decreasing their firepower by 5% and rate of fire by 12%, while giving them 5% vulnerability, lasting for 3 seconds. The skill then activates a shield with taunt effect and an independent health bar that is 1% of Judge's maximum HP, lasting for 2 seconds. All damage dealt to the shield will be fixed at 1.
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 15 seconds,Damage multiplier: 5x,Effect duration: 3 seconds,Firepower decrease: 5%,Rate of fire decrease: 12%,Vulnerability: 5%,Shield inherent HP: 1%,Shield duration: 2 seconds
    data_pool_1: "90"
    data_pool_2: "125,95,88,105"
