    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 4 seconds,Revision Mode damage increase:30%,Revision Mode ROF increase:30%,Full Marks Mode follow-up damage increase:10%,Full Marks Mode damage increase:30%,Full Marks Mode ROF increase:60%,Full Marks Mode accuracy increase:60%
