      Active: For 4 seconds, Black Marks on the enemy will not be removed by detonation and all enemy units have their accuracy and evasion reduced by 10%. While this skill is in effect, prioritize enemy units with no Dummies. After 1 seconds of aiming, deal 2x guaranteed damage that is reduced by armor and can score critical hits.
      '''
