    buff_id_target: 7417:10
    description: If the next battle takes place on a friendly-controlled node, place a 10% vulnerability debuff on all enemy units at the start of the battle for 15 seconds. When the debuff expires, all enemy units gain a shield with HP that equals 10% of a Dummy-Link's health, lasting for 5 seconds. If the next battle takes place on a non-friendly-controlled node, grant all friendly units a shield with HP that equals 30% of a Dummy-Link's health, lasting for 12 seconds. When the shields expire, increase all friendly units' damage according to the ratio of the shield's remaining HP to the Dummy-Link's health (capped at 30%), lasting for 8 seconds.
    lvup_description: Vulnerability: 10%,Enemy shield: 10%,Ally shield: 30%,Maximum damage increase: 30%
    code: wota
    train_coin_type: 1
    target_lost: 2
    is_switch: 1
    consumption: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
