      '''
      Passive: Every critical hit scored by each Dummy applies a mark to the target, stacking up to 15 times. When a target has a total of 15 marks, remove all enemies' shields, evasion buffs and armor buffs, while also reducing the target's evasion and armor by 30% for 5 seconds. An enemy can only be affected once by the debuff.
      Active: Increase all friendly units' critical chance by 6%. 1% vulnerability is also applied to the target for each mark present on the battlefield, lasting 3 seconds.
      '''
