      Passive: SGs on this unit's buff tiles gain a formation buff - whenever any units take damage, a teddy bear plushie appears in front of them and attracts enemy targeting. This effect can only trigger once every 15 seconds. The bear has 5% of this unit's max HP, 50% of her evasion and armor and lasts 5 seconds. 
      Active: Click the skill icon to toggle between different attack modes. Continuous Mode (default): reduce self damage and accuracy by 14% and increase the interval between attacks by 20%. Reloading is not needed in this mode.
      Burst Mode: Increase critical chance by 18% and critical damage by 36% and prioritize the enemy unit with the highest HP. After every 3 shots, the next shot does double damage.
      '''
