      Passive: Damage dealt by Alina is evenly distributed among the target's Dummy-Links. When an enemy unit has a Black Mark and a White Mark on them at the same time and Alina is on the battlefield, she detonates the marks (clearing them both) and deals 1.8x guaranteed <color=#db3d3d>explosive damage</color> that ignores armor.
      Active: For the next 11.3 seconds, her normal attack is enhanced into a three-part attack, the first two of which inflict <color=#91c1f0>melee damage</color> to a single unit, while the third part deals <color=#91c1f0>melee damage</color> in a radius of 3, while also triggering Rest In Peace. Every attack applies a permanent White Mark to the target. The damage multipliers for each part of her attack are 1.8x, 2.8x and 1.3x.
      '''
    lvup_description: Explosion multiplier: 1.8x,Duration: 11.3 seconds,Part 1 damage multiplier: 1.8x,Part 2 damage multiplier: 2.8x,Part 3 damage multiplier: 1.3x
