    description: Launches a grenade dealing 120% damage that can crit to enemies within a radius of 2.5. If it hits 3 or more enemies, amplify damage against those targets from all sources by 10% for 2 seconds. If it hits less than 3 enemies, increase own damage by 40% for 5 seconds. Then, launch an additional grenade dealing 100% damage that can crit to enemies within a radius of 2.5 units. (When equipped with "Zas Chip", this unit will initiate battle with 3 hand grenades in stock. After the start of battle, throw a grenade at the enemy unit with the highest HP every 10 seconds, dealing 100% damage within an area of 1 units and inflicts 10% vulnerability on them; this effect lasts 5 seconds.)
