    buff_id_self: 5331:1
    description: Launches a grenade dealing 160% damage that can crit to enemies within a radius of 2.5. If it hits 3 or more enemies, amplify damage against those targets from all sources by 11% for 2.2 seconds. If it hits less than 3 enemies, increase own damage by 44% for 5.6 seconds. Then, launch an additional grenade dealing 100% damage that can crit to enemies within a radius of 2.5 units. (When equipped with "Zas Chip", this unit will initiate battle with 3 hand grenades in stock. After the start of battle, throw a grenade at the enemy unit with the highest HP every 10 seconds, dealing 100% damage within an area of 1 units and inflicts 10% vulnerability on them; this effect lasts 5 seconds.)
    lvup_description: Cooldown: 15.1 seconds, AoE damage: 160%, Damage vulnerability: 11%, Damage vulnerability duration: 2.2 seconds, Damage increase: 44%, Damage increase duration: 5.6 seconds
    data_pool_1: "2.5,66,*7055,*7055"
