    buff_id_self: 9591:1,9604:1,9596:1000009469,9597:1000009469,9595:-25,1026:-25
    description:
      '''
      Passive: Receive one stack of Hunting Mark for every critical hit, capped at 25 stacks. Every time this unit participates in the successful killing of a target, convert all accumulated stacks of Hunting Mark into buffs, with each stack providing 2% damage and rate of fire increase for 10 seconds.
      Active: Immediately convert Hunting Marks and mark the highest HP enemy, directing the entire echelon to focus fire at it for 3 seconds. If the target is killed during the active skill, the entire echelon receives the effect of 5 converted Hunting Marks. (Not affected by the cap of 25 Hunting Marks.)
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown time: 10 seconds,Focus Fire duration:3%
    data_pool_1: "90"
    data_pool_2: "102,102"
    code: SIGCROSSIcon
