    name: Lock-On Shield
    skill_group_id: 1002801
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 5
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 450
    start_cd_time: 150
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 1
    action_id: 400
    is_form_action: 1
    buff_id_self: 9598:1
    description:
      '''
      Passive: This unit gains a shield when reloading that provides 50% damage reduction to self and gives all allies in the column in front a 100 HP shield, lasting for 3 seconds.
      Active: Turn on Lock-On mode for 5 seconds, which enables this unit to attack without consuming ammo or reloading. This unit will prioritize the highest HP enemy, with each attack or critical hit increasing self damage by 3. (Changing the target or ending Lock-On mode clears this buff.)
      '''
