  {
    id: 100350101
    name: Physical Passivation
    skill_group_id: 1003501
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 2
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 300
    start_cd_time: 150
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 2
    action_id: 400
    is_form_action: 1
    buff_id_target: 9657:1000009510
    buff_id_self: 9643:3
    description:
      '''
      Passive: Each attack has a 10% chance of reducing the target's armor and evasion by 6% for 5 seconds, stacking up to 5 times.
      Active: Upon activation, the next 3 attacks will deal 3x damage to the enemy with the highest HP and will always trigger the passive armor and evasion debuffs. If the target has a stat buff, dispel one type of stat buff and increase the damage of all echelon members by 10% for 5 seconds.
      (When equipped with Medkit, upon skill activation, grant all allies who have lost Dummy-Links a shield with 10% of Evita's maximum HP for 10 seconds.)
      '''
    lvup_description: Cooldown: 10 seconds,Armor and Evasion debuff: 6%,Duration: 5 seconds,Damage multiplier: 3x
    code: evitaskill
