      Active: Upon activation, the next 3 attacks will deal 3.5x damage to the enemy with the highest HP and will always trigger the passive armor and evasion debuffs. If the target has a stat buff, dispel one type of stat buff and increase the damage of all echelon members by 10% for 5 seconds.
      (When equipped with Medkit, upon skill activation, grant all allies who have lost Dummy-Links a shield with 10% of Evita's maximum HP for 10 seconds.)
