  {
    id: 100570101
    name: Coordinates Locked
    skill_group_id: 1005701
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 8
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 30
    start_cd_time: 30
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 3
    action_id: 400
    buff_id_target: 9782:-99,9785:-2
    buff_id_self: 9786:1000009662,9787:1000009663,9788:1000009657,10002:1,9778:-1,9779:-1,9783:-10,9784:-10,9780:-1,9781:-1,9775:-1,9776:-1
    description:
      '''
      Switch between attack modes by clicking the skill in battle. Initial default is Upright Shooting Mode.
      Upright Shooting Mode: Attack the furthest enemy unit, dealing 160% damage with the first attack on each target and reducing their move speed and evasion by 20% for 3 seconds. When switching to this mode, increase damage and accuracy by 20% until switching to another mode.
      Hip Shooting Mode: Attack the nearest enemy unit, dealing two instances of 60% damage. The lower the target's HP, the higher the damage (increase damage by 8% for every 10% target's HP lost, with damage increase capping at 30%). When switching to this mode, accuracy is reduced by 50% until switching to another mode.
      Prone Shooting Mode: Attack an enemy elite unit, and increase self damage and accuracy by 6% for every successive attack on the same target to a maximum of 10 stacks. The number of stacks is halved when switching to another target and drops to zero when switching to another mode. When switching to this mode, increase accuracy by 50% until switching to another mode.
      '''
    lvup_description: Upright Shooting Mode damage multiplier: 160%,Upright Shooting Mode move speed and evasion reduction: 20%,Upright Shooting Mode damage and accuracy increase: 20%,Hit Shooting Mode damage multiplier: 60%,Prone Shooting Mode damage and accuracy increase: 6%
    code: HTISkill
    train_coin_type: 1
    is_switch: 1
    passive_name: battle_skill_config-500570101
    is_manual: 1
    is_cdr: 1
    skill_lv_call: 1
    special_buff_trigger: "2"
  }
