    description:
      '''
      Switch between attack modes by clicking the skill in battle. Initial default is Upright Shooting Mode.
      Upright Shooting Mode: Attack the furthest enemy unit, dealing 190% damage with the first attack on each target and reducing their move speed and evasion by 27% for 3 seconds. When switching to this mode, increase damage and accuracy by 27% until switching to another mode.
      Hip Shooting Mode: Attack the nearest enemy unit, dealing two instances of 70% damage. The lower the target's HP, the higher the damage (increase damage by 8% for every 10% target's HP lost, with damage increase capping at 30%). When switching to this mode, accuracy is reduced by 50% until switching to another mode.
      Prone Shooting Mode: Attack an enemy elite unit, and increase self damage and accuracy by 9% for every successive attack on the same target to a maximum of 10 stacks. The number of stacks is halved when switching to another target and drops to zero when switching to another mode. When switching to this mode, increase accuracy by 50% until switching to another mode.
      '''
