      '''
      The more HP lost by this unit, the more damage dealt, to a maximum of 300%. When enemy units lose dummy-links, gain 1 point(s) of Geist and when ally units lose dummy-links, gain  10 points of Geist. 
       Upon reaching 20 points of Geist, the next attack against the highest-threat enemy is enhanced to deal 800% damage, it is guaranteed to hit and this unit loses 20 points of Geist. After triggering 5 enhanced attacks, become immune to damage for 20 seconds after becoming heavily damaged during this battle.
      '''
